         <component>
            <section ID="id_link_4e6cbbfc-96c8-3d7e-e063-6294a90a657d">
               <id root="4e6cbbfc-96c7-3d7e-e063-6294a90a657d"/>
               <code code="34068-7" codeSystem="2.16.840.1.113883.6.1" displayName="DOSAGE &amp; ADMINISTRATION SECTION"/>
               <title>Directions: Use as Directed</title>
               <text>
                  <paragraph>This prescription dentifrice is recommended for adults and pediatric patients six years and older.
  <br/>
• Apply a thin ribbon of PRO-SYS Professional along the length of the toothbrush no more than "pea size" total dose. Brush for two minutes.
  <br/>
• After brushing: ADULTS-Expectorate; do not eat or drink for 30 minutes. CHILDREN SIX YEARS OF AGE OR OLDER-Expectorate and rinse mouth with water.
  <br/>
• Use at bedtime in place of your regular toothpaste or as directed by your dental professional.
 </paragraph>
               </text>
               <effectiveTime value="20260201"/>
            </section>
